{
    "title": "Baby Panda's Daily Habits",
    "description": "This time, BabyBus has brought you a game that focuses on developing kids' life habits. Go with Baby Panda and check it out!\r\n\r\nSIX DAILY HABITS\r\nThis game is aimed to develop kids' six daily habits, such as going to the toilet by themselves, sleeping on time, and having a balanced diet. Through fun interactions, it allows the kids to master life skills like going to the toilet by themselves, and develop good life habits!\r\n\r\nDETAILED OPERATION GUIDE\r\nIn this game, kids can not only learn how to go to the toilet, but also learn to brush their teeth, wash their face and hands. Developing habits become easy with these interesting and detailed instructions.\r\n\r\nCUTE CHARACTERS' REACTIONS\r\nWhen a little boy wants to go to the toilet, his face will turn red. When a little girl has delicious food, she will exclaim with satisfaction. These cute characters' reactions add zest to the game and will make kids more interested in developing habits!\r\n\r\nCome to this game and explore more good life habits! Let your kids learn to have a balanced diet, work and rest on time, and go to the toilet independently!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Various interactions covering 6 ways to develop daily habits;\r\n- Cute characters that make habit development interesting;\r\n- Family scenes that let kids enjoy developing habits;\r\n- Fun interactions are suitable for kids;\r\n- Kid-friendly simple operations;\r\n- Supports offline play!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "This time, BabyBus has brought you a game that focuses on developing kids&#39; life habits. Go with Baby Panda and check it out!<br><br>SIX DAILY HABITS<br>This game is aimed to develop kids&#39; six daily habits, such as going to the toilet by themselves, sleeping on time, and having a balanced diet. Through fun interactions, it allows the kids to master life skills like going to the toilet by themselves, and develop good life habits!<br><br>DETAILED OPERATION GUIDE<br>In this game, kids can not only learn how to go to the toilet, but also learn to brush their teeth, wash their face and hands. Developing habits become easy with these interesting and detailed instructions.<br><br>CUTE CHARACTERS&#39; REACTIONS<br>When a little boy wants to go to the toilet, his face will turn red. When a little girl has delicious food, she will exclaim with satisfaction. These cute characters&#39; reactions add zest to the game and will make kids more interested in developing habits!<br><br>Come to this game and explore more good life habits! Let your kids learn to have a balanced diet, work and rest on time, and go to the toilet independently!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- Various interactions covering 6 ways to develop daily habits;<br>- Cute characters that make habit development interesting;<br>- Family scenes that let kids enjoy developing habits;<br>- Fun interactions are suitable for kids;<br>- Kid-friendly simple operations;<br>- Supports offline play!<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children&#39;s apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>Contact us: ser@babybus.com<br>Visit us: http://www.babybus.com",
